{{> studentTop}}
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TURN RESULTS INTO NEXT STEPS</p><h1>My results & skills gaps</h1><p class="muted">See where your knowledge evidence is strongest and what to work on next.</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/student/results/download">Download PDF report ↓</a></div>
<div class="notice info">Each area uses the latest completed attempt per course, averaged across courses in that area. The latest diagnostic is used only where no completed course evidence exists. Repeating one course does not multiply its weight.</div>
<div class="grid cols-4">{{#each domains}}<section class="card"><span class="chip {{#if gap}}rose{{/if}}">{{#if known}}{{#if gap}}Learning priority{{else}}Knowledge strength{{/if}}{{else}}Not assessed{{/if}}</span><h2 class="space-top">{{name}}</h2><div class="stat"><strong class="value">{{#if known}}{{score}}%{{else}}—{{/if}}</strong></div><div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="--progress:{{#if known}}{{score}}{{else}}0{{/if}}%"></div></div><p class="small muted">{{#if gap}}Explore courses in this area and complete an assessment.{{else}}Keep practising and seek practical feedback from faculty.{{/if}}</p></section>{{/each}}</div>
<section class="card space-top"><h2>Course assessment history</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Course</th><th>Attempt</th><th>Status</th><th>Progress</th><th>Final score</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each attempts}}<tr><td><a href="/student/learn/{{id}}">{{title}}</a></td><td>#{{attemptNumber}}</td><td>{{status}}</td><td>{{percent}}%</td><td>{{#if (eq finalScore null)}}Not taken{{else}}{{finalScore}}%{{/if}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">No course results yet.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="card space-top"><h2>Diagnostic history</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Score</th><th>Version</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each assessments}}<tr><td>{{date}}</td><td>{{score}}%</td><td>{{version}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="3" class="empty">Take your first knowledge diagnostic to see a starting snapshot.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></section><p class="small muted space-top">Communication, workplace performance and professional qualifications need separate practical evaluation. Completion and knowledge scores alone cannot establish employment readiness.</p>
{{> studentBottom}}
